{"seq":2,"slug":"workload-modeling","title":"负载模型与流量建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/foundations/workload-modeling","wordCount":1287,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"负载模型与流量建模\">负载模型与流量建模</h1><p>好的负载测试始于好的模型。流量建模解决的是：如何把「真实用户的行为」转化成测试工具能理解的参数，同时保留统计真实性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闭合模型</td>\n<td>固定 VU 数量，响应时间变化时 RPS 自动调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放模型</td>\n<td>固定到达率，响应时间变化时队列积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Think Time</td>\n<td>用户操作之间的停顿时间，影响实际 RPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pacing</td>\n<td>控制每 VU 完成一次业务流程的间隔时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SharedArray</td>\n<td>k6 中所有 VU 共享的只读数据集，避免重复加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数化</td>\n<td>使用不同测试数据驱动请求，避免缓存失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HAR 文件</td>\n<td>浏览器录制的 HTTP 请求日志，可转换为测试脚本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"开放模型-vs-闭合模型\">开放模型 vs 闭合模型</h2><p>这是流量建模中最基础也最容易混淆的概念。</p>\n<h3 id=\"闭合模型-closed-model\">闭合模型（Closed Model）</h3><p>用固定数量的虚拟用户（VU）驱动请求，每个 VU 完成一次请求后立即发起下一次（或等待 think time 后再发）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    VU1[VU 1] --&gt; |发请求| Server&#10;    Server --&gt; |收到响应| VU1&#10;    VU1 --&gt; |think time| VU1&#10;    VU2[VU 2] --&gt; |发请求| Server&#10;    VU3[VU 3] --&gt; |发请求| Server\">graph LR\n    VU1[VU 1] --&gt; |发请求| Server\n    Server --&gt; |收到响应| VU1\n    VU1 --&gt; |think time| VU1\n    VU2[VU 2] --&gt; |发请求| Server\n    VU3[VU 3] --&gt; |发请求| Server</pre><p><strong>特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>系统变慢时，VU 卡在等待，实际发出的 RPS 自动下降</li>\n<li>容易设置，符合「用户总数固定」的直觉</li>\n<li>k6 默认模式，大多数工具默认模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺陷</strong>：在高延迟情况下，VU 排队等待，实际到达服务器的请求率会下降，掩盖了队列堆积的真实情况。</p>\n<h3 id=\"开放模型-open-model\">开放模型（Open Model）</h3><p>以固定的<strong>到达率</strong>（arrival rate）向系统注入请求，无论服务器响应时间如何，请求都按计划到达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Timer[定时器&lt;br/&gt;100 req/s] --&gt; |按速率注入| Queue[请求队列]&#10;    Queue --&gt; Server[服务器]&#10;    Server --&gt; |响应| Client[客户端]\">graph LR\n    Timer[定时器&lt;br/&gt;100 req/s] --&gt; |按速率注入| Queue[请求队列]\n    Queue --&gt; Server[服务器]\n    Server --&gt; |响应| Client[客户端]</pre><p><strong>特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更真实地模拟互联网流量（用户不会因为你的服务慢就停止访问）</li>\n<li>当服务器变慢时，队列积压，延迟急剧上升——这才是真实的压力测试场景</li>\n<li>k6 的 <code>constant-arrival-rate</code> executor 实现开放模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"选哪种\">选哪种？</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建立性能基线</td>\n<td>闭合</td>\n<td>结果稳定，便于对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试真实压力行为</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>真实模拟流量到达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量规划</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>能看到队列堆积拐点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户行为复杂的场景</td>\n<td>闭合</td>\n<td>状态管理更简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中两种结合使用效果最好：用闭合模型做 baseline，用开放模型做压力测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户行为建模\">用户行为建模</h2><p>真实用户不只是循环调用一个接口，他们有完整的操作序列，有停顿，有不同的行为路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"think-time-思考时间\">Think Time（思考时间）</h3><p>用户在每次操作之间的停顿时间，对请求率有决定性影响。</p>\n<p>常见建模方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>代码示例</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定 think time</td>\n<td><code>sleep(1)</code></td>\n<td>简单场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均匀随机</td>\n<td><code>sleep(random(0.5, 2))</code></td>\n<td>模拟差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负指数分布</td>\n<td>按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) = 1 - e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 采样</td>\n<td>最符合真实行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从真实日志提取</td>\n<td>回放录制的 HAR 文件</td>\n<td>最高真实性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>k6 中的 think time 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { sleep } from &#39;k6&#39;;&#10;import { randomExponential } from &#39;k6/x/faker&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function () {&#10;  // 发送请求&#10;  http.get(&#39;https://example.com/api/products&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 指数分布的 think time，均值 2 秒&#10;  sleep(randomExponential(2));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { sleep } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'k6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { randomExponential } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'k6/x/faker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 发送请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com/api/products'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 指数分布的 think time，均值 2 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomExponential</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"用户场景权重\">用户场景权重</h3><p>真实系统中，不同用户行为的比例是不均匀的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"常见电商平台流量分布示例：&#10;- 浏览商品列表：55%&#10;- 搜索：25%&#10;- 查看商品详情：15%&#10;- 加购/下单：5%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>常见电商平台流量分布示例：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 浏览商品列表：55%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索：25%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 查看商品详情：15%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 加购/下单：5%</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 k6 中用 scenarios 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export const options = {&#10;  scenarios: {&#10;    browse: {&#10;      executor: &#39;constant-vus&#39;,&#10;      vus: 55,&#10;      duration: &#39;10m&#39;,&#10;      exec: &#39;browseCatalog&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    search: {&#10;      executor: &#39;constant-vus&#39;,&#10;      vus: 25,&#10;      duration: &#39;10m&#39;,&#10;      exec: &#39;searchProducts&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    checkout: {&#10;      executor: &#39;constant-vus&#39;,&#10;      vus: 5,&#10;      duration: &#39;10m&#39;,&#10;      exec: &#39;checkoutFlow&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;export function browseCatalog() {&#10;  /* ... */&#10;}&#10;export function searchProducts() {&#10;  /* ... */&#10;}&#10;export function checkoutFlow() {&#10;  /* ... */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scenarios: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    browse: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      executor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'constant-vus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      vus: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exec: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'browseCatalog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    search: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      executor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'constant-vus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      vus: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exec: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'searchProducts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    checkout: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      executor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'constant-vus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      vus: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exec: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkoutFlow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> browseCatalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> searchProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkoutFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pacing-步调控制\">Pacing（步调控制）</h3><p>Pacing 控制每个 VU 在一个完整业务流程（scenario）的执行间隔，确保每分钟完成固定数量的业务流程。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pace</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mtext>目标每分钟场景数</mtext></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mtext>场景执行时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pace} = \\frac{60}{\\text{目标每分钟场景数}} - \\text{场景执行时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pace</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标每分钟场景数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">场景执行时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果场景执行时间超过 pace，说明系统已经无法满足目标吞吐，需要报警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流量形态建模\">流量形态建模</h2><h3 id=\"基础负载形态\">基础负载形态</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Ramp-up 期] --&gt; B[稳定期]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Ramp-down 期]\">graph LR\n    A[Ramp-up 期] --&gt; B[稳定期]\n    B --&gt; C[Ramp-down 期]</pre><p>k6 中的 stages 定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export const options = {&#10;  stages: [&#10;    { duration: &#39;2m&#39;, target: 100 }, // ramp-up 到 100 VU&#10;    { duration: &#39;10m&#39;, target: 100 }, // 保持 100 VU&#10;    { duration: &#39;2m&#39;, target: 0 }, // ramp-down&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stages: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ramp-up 到 100 VU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保持 100 VU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ramp-down</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"日周期性负载\">日周期性负载</h3><p>实际系统流量通常呈日周期模式，可以用分段 stages 模拟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export const options = {&#10;  stages: [&#10;    { duration: &#39;1h&#39;, target: 50 }, // 凌晨低谷&#10;    { duration: &#39;2h&#39;, target: 200 }, // 早高峰 ramp-up&#10;    { duration: &#39;3h&#39;, target: 200 }, // 早高峰稳定&#10;    { duration: &#39;1h&#39;, target: 100 }, // 午间下降&#10;    { duration: &#39;2h&#39;, target: 300 }, // 晚高峰&#10;    { duration: &#39;3h&#39;, target: 300 }, // 晚高峰稳定&#10;    { duration: &#39;2h&#39;, target: 50 }, // 夜间下降&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stages: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 凌晨低谷</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 早高峰 ramp-up</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 早高峰稳定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 午间下降</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 晚高峰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 晚高峰稳定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 夜间下降</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"到达率模型-开放模型\">到达率模型（开放模型）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export const options = {&#10;  scenarios: {&#10;    api_load: {&#10;      executor: &#39;ramping-arrival-rate&#39;,&#10;      startRate: 10,&#10;      timeUnit: &#39;1s&#39;, // 10 req/s 起始&#10;      preAllocatedVUs: 50,&#10;      maxVUs: 200,&#10;      stages: [&#10;        { target: 100, duration: &#39;5m&#39; }, // 线性增加到 100 req/s&#10;        { target: 100, duration: &#39;10m&#39; }, // 保持 100 req/s&#10;        { target: 0, duration: &#39;2m&#39; }, // 降低&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scenarios: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    api_load: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      executor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ramping-arrival-rate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      startRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      timeUnit: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10 req/s 起始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      preAllocatedVUs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      maxVUs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stages: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 线性增加到 100 req/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 保持 100 req/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { target: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 降低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试数据策略\">测试数据策略</h2><h3 id=\"数据多样性的重要性\">数据多样性的重要性</h3><p>使用相同的测试数据（如固定的用户 ID、商品 ID）会导致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缓存命中率异常高，掩盖真实数据库压力</li>\n<li>并发写同一条记录，产生锁竞争，不代表真实场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"参数化数据\">参数化数据</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { SharedArray } from &#39;k6/data&#39;;&#10;import { randomItem } from &#39;k6/x/faker&#39;;&#10;&#10;// SharedArray 在所有 VU 间共享，避免重复加载&#10;const users = new SharedArray(&#39;users&#39;, function () {&#10;  return JSON.parse(open(&#39;./test-data/users.json&#39;));&#10;});&#10;&#10;const products = new SharedArray(&#39;products&#39;, function () {&#10;  return JSON.parse(open(&#39;./test-data/products.json&#39;));&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default function () {&#10;  const user = randomItem(users);&#10;  const product = randomItem(products);&#10;&#10;  http.post(&#10;    &#39;/api/cart&#39;,&#10;    JSON.stringify({&#10;      userId: user.id,&#10;      productId: product.id,&#10;      quantity: Math.floor(Math.random() * 5) + 1,&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { SharedArray } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'k6/data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { randomItem } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'k6/x/faker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SharedArray 在所有 VU 间共享，避免重复加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./test-data/users.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'products'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./test-data/products.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> randomItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> randomItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(products);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '/api/cart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      userId: user.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      productId: product.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      quantity: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试数据规模建议\">测试数据规模建议</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>最小建议量</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户账号</td>\n<td>≥ 并发 VU 数的 5 倍</td>\n<td>避免重复登录冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品/内容数据</td>\n<td>≥ 10,000 条</td>\n<td>代表真实缓存行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史订单数据</td>\n<td>≥ 100,000 条</td>\n<td>代表真实数据库查询计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流量录制与回放\">流量录制与回放</h2><p>最准确的流量模型是直接录制真实生产流量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"har-文件回放\">HAR 文件回放</h3><p>浏览器开发者工具可以导出 HAR 文件，k6 可以将其转换为测试脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 将 HAR 文件转换为 k6 脚本&#10;k6 convert --input-type har recording.har -o test_script.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将 HAR 文件转换为 k6 脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">k6</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> convert</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --input-type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> har</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> recording.har</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test_script.js</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"流量录制工具\">流量录制工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>适用层</th>\n<th>输出格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Browser DevTools</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>HAR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mitmproxy</td>\n<td>HTTP/HTTPS</td>\n<td>HAR, Python</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tcpdump + tcpreplay</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>原始流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nginx mirror</td>\n<td>生产流量镜像</td>\n<td>实时复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>流量建模的核心是：用对模型（闭合 vs 开放），加上真实的用户行为参数（think time、场景权重）和足够多样的测试数据。Little&#39;s Law <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 是建模的数学基础，从生产数据推算 VU 数是常规操作。哪条路径最快达到真实性：录制 HAR 文件直接回放 &gt; 从生产日志提取分布 &gt; 手动参数化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兄弟文档导航\">兄弟文档导航</h2>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"负载模型与流量建模","id":"负载模型与流量建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"开放模型 vs 闭合模型","id":"开放模型-vs-闭合模型"},{"level":3,"text":"闭合模型（Closed Model）","id":"闭合模型-closed-model"},{"level":3,"text":"开放模型（Open Model）","id":"开放模型-open-model"},{"level":3,"text":"选哪种？","id":"选哪种"},{"level":2,"text":"用户行为建模","id":"用户行为建模"},{"level":3,"text":"Think Time（思考时间）","id":"think-time-思考时间"},{"level":3,"text":"用户场景权重","id":"用户场景权重"},{"level":3,"text":"Pacing（步调控制）","id":"pacing-步调控制"},{"level":2,"text":"流量形态建模","id":"流量形态建模"},{"level":3,"text":"基础负载形态","id":"基础负载形态"},{"level":3,"text":"日周期性负载","id":"日周期性负载"},{"level":3,"text":"到达率模型（开放模型）","id":"到达率模型-开放模型"},{"level":2,"text":"测试数据策略","id":"测试数据策略"},{"level":3,"text":"数据多样性的重要性","id":"数据多样性的重要性"},{"level":3,"text":"参数化数据","id":"参数化数据"},{"level":3,"text":"测试数据规模建议","id":"测试数据规模建议"},{"level":2,"text":"流量录制与回放","id":"流量录制与回放"},{"level":3,"text":"HAR 文件回放","id":"har-文件回放"},{"level":3,"text":"流量录制工具","id":"流量录制工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档导航","id":"兄弟文档导航"}],"prev":{"title":"性能测试类型与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/foundations/performance-testing-types"},"next":{"title":"性能指标、SLO 与错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/foundations/metrics-slos-budgets"}}